Your healdesk invoice for $897 is also still unpaid. Paying it settles what's owed, but doesn't restore the service on its own.

Pay the invoice: https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_testplatform/test_invoice

Reply to this email and we'll tell you what's needed to restore it.

If your clinic's line forwards to AYA, you can undo that while this is sorted out. Follow these AT&T steps, dialling each code from the clinic's own line:

- Cancel busy forwarding on AT&T Phone: *91#
- Cancel no-answer forwarding on AT&T Phone: *93#
- Cancel Safe Call Forwarding on AT&T Phone: *373#
- On AT&T Phone, those codes don't bring back AT&T voicemail for missed calls. To send unanswered and busy calls to voicemail again on AT&T Phone for Business, sign in to your AT&T account, open Voicemail Settings and set No Answer and Busy Call Forwarding to Forward to Voice Mail; on AT&T Phone at home, ask AT&T to set them back to voicemail.
- On a traditional AT&T landline, call AT&T on 800.288.2020 to remove busy and no-answer forwarding, or to set it back to your voicemail if that's where it went before.
- On an AT&T mobile line, turn the forwarding off in the phone's own call-forwarding settings (AT&T lets forwarding be changed only from the phone itself).

—
You're receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa's healdesk account.
Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.
800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States
",
}
`;

